        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="Comment679" annotatedElement="DataType27">
          <body>A color.
Color is based on the RGB color model (e.g., see Wikipedia [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RGB_color_spaces] for an overview). For each channel red, green, and blue, Color has an attribute R, G, and B that gives the intensity of the channel. Intensities are given as values of UnsignedByte, i.e., integers in the range [0, 255].</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
